// 007.3, 008.3 (D35, #55, #57, #60): `Duty ... Overrides other(args)` with swapped roles,
// `Excused when` on `Extend Duty`, `Input Fact`, and `Qualifies as`.
Fact parent Identified by Daniel, Rosa
Input Bool storm
Bool handed
Duty hand-over Holder parent Claimant parent' Due within 1
Duty make-up Holder parent Claimant parent'
  Overrides hand-over(parent', parent)
Extend Duty hand-over Excused when storm()
Act deliver Actor parent Recipient parent' Holds when True Creates handed()
Act courier-drop Actor parent Recipient parent' Holds when True
  Qualifies as deliver(parent, parent')
.
+hand-over(Daniel, Rosa).
@ 1.
?violated hand-over(Daniel, Rosa).
// Storm excuses violation while `hand-over` itself still holds:
+storm().
?hand-over(Daniel, Rosa).
?!violated hand-over(Daniel, Rosa).
-storm().
?violated hand-over(Daniel, Rosa).
// Rosa's make-up duty overrides Daniel->Rosa hand-over (swapped roles!):
+make-up(Rosa, Daniel).
?!violated hand-over(Daniel, Rosa).
courier-drop(Daniel, Rosa).
?handed().
